<section class="rule"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Original frameworks</div><h2>Tools that make transformation decisions visible.</h2><p class="lead">Each framework is proprietary Trouvus intellectual property, developed from research and translated through executive education and practical decision design.</p>
<div class="grid-3">
<div class="card tactile"><img src="/images/strategy-to-scale.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Strategy-to-Scale Framework diagram: Diagnose, Prioritize, Design, Pilot, Scale" width="640" height="300" style="border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:14px"><h3>Strategy-to-Scale Framework</h3><p class="muted">A five-stage operating discipline—Diagnose, Prioritize, Design, Pilot, Scale—for moving from uncertainty to governed capability.</p><a href="/approach/">Explore the framework →</a></div>
<div class="card tactile"><img src="/images/readiness-diagnostic.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="AI Transformation Readiness Diagnostic radar across five capability dimensions" width="640" height="300" style="border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:14px"><h3>AI Transformation Readiness Diagnostic</h3><p class="muted">Assesses strategic alignment, data, technology, governance and workforce capability before a single tool is selected.</p><a href="/expertise/#strategy">Where it is used →</a></div>
<div class="card tactile"><img src="/images/habmc.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Human-Augmented Business Model Canvas grid" width="640" height="300" style="border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:14px"><h3>Human-Augmented Business Model Canvas</h3><p class="muted">A business-model lens for deciding where machines should automate, where they should augment and where human judgment must remain load-bearing.</p><a href="/insights/human-augmented-business-model-canvas/">Read the framework article →</a></div>
